      question: 'Курс онлайн форматта да бар ма?',
      answer: approved
        ? `Иә (${c.stand}). Осы беттегі әр рұқсаты бар курста оның аудиторияда немесе онлайн өтетіні көрсетілген. ${plannedName} 45 күндік семинарын екі нұсқада да ұсынамыз. Қайсысы сізге сай екенін кеңес кезінде бірге анықтаймыз.`
        : `Иә (${c.stand}). ${plannedName} 45 күндік семинары аудиторияда да, тікелей онлайн да өтеді, тренерлер мен мазмұн бірдей. Екі нұсқаға да рұқсат дайындалуда. Онлайн форматта ештеңе орнатпай, тікелей браузер арқылы қатысасыз. Қай нұсқа сізге сай екенін кеңес кезінде бірге анықтаймыз.`,
    },
    {
      question: 'Емтиханнан кейін не болады?',
      answer: `WAMOCON Academy емтиханнан кейін де сізді жалғыз қалдырмайды (${c.stand}). Өтініштеріңізді дайындауға көмектесеміз. Сертификат алған соң WAMOCON қауымдастығына қосылып, басқа түлектермен пікір алмаса аласыз. Курс аяқталғанда, сондай-ақ үш және алты айдан кейін хабарласып, жұмысыңыз қалай екенін сұраймыз. Жұмыс орнына уәде бере алмаймыз, бірақ бастауыңызға көмектесеміз.`,
    },
    {
      question: 'WAMOCON қандай салаларда тәжірибе жинады?',
      answer: `WAMOCON Academy-дің бауырлас компаниясы WAMOCON GmbH 2007 жылдан бері 15-тен астам салада бағдарламаларды тестілеп, алты елде жобалар жүргізді (${c.stand}). Олардың ішінде: ${listFormat.format(sectors.map((sector) => sector.name.kk))}. wamocon.com сайтында ${allRefs.length} референс-клиент атап көрсетілген, олардың ішінде Deutsche Bank, Deutsche Telekom, Deutsche Bahn, EnBW және Германияның Федералдық жұмыспен қамту агенттігі бар. 45 күндік семинар тренерлері осы жобалардағы жағдайларды сабаққа әкеледі.`,
    },
    {
      question: 'WAMOCON Academy-ді кім тексерді?',
      answer: `Бізді ${bt.fachkundigeStelle.ort} қаласындағы ${bt.fachkundigeStelle.name} тексерді (${c.stand}). Ол fachkundige Stelle, яғни Германияда жұмыспен қамтуға жәрдемдесу үшін білім беру ұйымдары мен курстарға рұқсат беретін аккредиттелген сараптама органы. Тексеру ${reviewMonth} өтті. Содан кейін WAMOCON Academy GmbH ${bt.paragraf} бойынша ұйымға берілетін алғашқы рұқсатты алды. Рұқсат берілген бағыт: ${bt.fachbereich.nummer}-бағыт, кәсіптік біліктілікті арттыру.${certNo && certFrom && certUntil ? ` Сертификат нөмірі ${certNo}, ${certFrom} бастап ${certUntil} дейін жарамды.` : ''}`,
    },
    {
      question: 'Шағымды қалай беруге болады?',
      answer: `Бір нәрсе дұрыс болмаса, біз оны білгіміз келеді (${c.stand}). WAMOCON Academy GmbH-ге жеке өзіңіз, телефон, электрондық пошта немесе пікір платформалары арқылы хабарласа аласыз. Әр шағымды басшылық қарап, құжаттайды. Бізге ${company.phone} нөмірі немесе ${company.email} поштасы арқылы хабарласыңыз.`,
    },
  ],
});
---

<div class="bt-page">
  <div class="bt-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-bt-progress></span></div>
  <!-- ================================================================ HERO -->
  <section class="bt-hero" aria-labelledby="bt-hero-title">
    <div class="bt-hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src={heroImage} alt="" width="1144" height="960" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>
    <div class="bt-hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bt-aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container bt-hero__inner">
      <div class="bt-hero__copy" data-reveal>
        <div class="bt-hero__badges">
          <span class="bt-new">{c.newBadge}</span>
          {showMark ? (
            <span class="bt-hero__kicker">
              <img src={bt.zeichenDatei} alt={c.markAlt} width={bt.zeichenBreite ?? undefined} height={bt.zeichenHoehe ?? undefined} />
              {c.markText}
            </span>
          ) : (
            <span class="bt-hero__kicker">{c.heroKicker}</span>
          )}
        </div>
        <h1 id="bt-hero-title"><span>{c.heroLead}</span> {c.heroRest}</h1>
        <ul class="bt-hero__trust">
          {c.heroTrust.map(([label, text, href]) => {
            const inner = (
              <>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3 20 6v6c0 4.5-3.4 8.3-8 9-4.6-.7-8-4.5-8-9V6l8-3z" /><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg>
                <span><strong>{label}</strong> {text}</span>
              </>
            );
            return <li>{href ? <a href={href}>{inner}</a> : <span>{inner}</span>}</li>;
          })}
        </ul>
        <p class="bt-hero__lead">{c.heroText}</p>
        <div class="bt-hero__actions">
          <Button href={`#${formAnchor}`} size="lg">{cta}</Button>
          <Button href={`#${seminarAnchor}`} size="lg" variant="outline">{c.ctaSeminar}</Button>
        </div>
        {!approved && <p class="bt-hero__note">{c.heroNote}</p>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================== SEALS -->
  <section class="bt-seals" aria-label={c.sealsLabel}>
    <ul class="container bt-seals__list">
      {medals.map((medal) => (
        <li class:list={['bt-seal', 'bt-spot', { 'has-link': medal.href }]} data-reveal>
          <span class="bt-seal__visual" aria-hidden="true">
            {medal.kind === 'image' && (
              <img class="bt-seal__logo" src={istqbLogo.src} alt="" width={istqbLogo.size} height={istqbLogo.size} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            )}
            {medal.kind === 'rating' && (
              <span class="bt-rating">
                <span class="bt-rating__value">{medal.main}</span>
                <span class="bt-rating__stars">
                  {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((i) => (
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" style={`--i:${i}`}><path d={starPath} /></svg>
                  ))}
                </span>
              </span>
            )}
            {medal.kind === 'medal' && (
            <svg class="bt-medal" viewBox="0 0 120 120" focusable="false">
              <defs><path id={`bt-medal-${medal.key}`} d={ringPath} /></defs>
              <circle class="bt-medal__outer" cx="60" cy="60" r="58" />
              <circle class="bt-medal__dash" cx="60" cy="60" r="38.5" />
              <g class="bt-medal__ring">
                <text><textPath href={`#bt-medal-${medal.key}`} textLength="286" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs">{medal.ring}</textPath></text>
              </g>
              <circle class="bt-medal__core" cx="60" cy="60" r="35" />
              <text class="bt-medal__main" x="60" y="63" text-anchor="middle" style={`font-size:${medal.mainSize}px`}>{medal.main}</text>
              <text class="bt-medal__sub" x="60" y="78" text-anchor="middle">{medal.sub}</text>
            </svg>
            )}
          </span>
          <strong>{medal.title}</strong>
          <span class="bt-seal__text">{medal.text}</span>
          {medal.href && <a class="bt-seal__link" href={medal.href} aria-label={c.sealCertLink}></a>}
        </li>
      ))}
      {seals.map((seal) => (
        <li class="bt-seal bt-spot" data-reveal>
          {/* The visible caption names the seal, so the image itself is decorative. */}
          <span class="bt-seal__visual"><img src={seal.datei} alt="" width={seal.breite!} height={seal.hoehe!} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
          <strong>{seal.label[lang]}</strong>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================== SHOWCASE -->
  <section class="bt-showcase" id={seminarAnchor} aria-labelledby="bt-showcase-title">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="bt-showcase__panel" data-reveal>
        <div class="bt-aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="bt-showcase__top">
          <div class="bt-showcase__intro">
            <p class="bt-showcase__eyebrow"><span class="bt-signal">{c.showcaseEyebrow}</span></p>
            <p class="bt-showcase__days"><strong data-count-to={bt.seminar.tage} data-count-suffix="">{bt.seminar.tage}</strong> <span>{c.showcaseDays}</span></p>
            <h2 id="bt-showcase-title">{bt.seminar.titel}</h2>
            <p class="bt-showcase__sub">{c.showcaseSub}</p>
            <p class="bt-showcase__text">{c.showcaseText}</p>
            <p class="bt-showcase__status">{approved ? c.showcaseStatusApproved : c.showcaseStatusPlanned}</p>
            <div class="bt-showcase__cta"><Button href={`#${formAnchor}`}>{cta}</Button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="bt-glance">
            <h3>{c.glanceLabel}</h3>
            <dl>
              {glanceRows.map((row) => (
                <div class:list={[row.kind && `is-${row.kind}`]}>
                  <dt>{row.term}</dt>
                  <dd>
                    {row.kind === 'price' || row.kind === 'regular' ? (
                      <>
                        <strong class="bt-glance__price">{row.value}</strong>
                        <span class="bt-glance__small">{row.small}</span>
                      </>
                    ) : (
                      row.value
                    )}
                    {row.kind === 'goal' && (
                      <span class="bt-glance__badge" title="ISTQB® CTFL">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                          <circle class="bt-glance__badge-bg" cx="20" cy="20" r="19" />
                          <circle class="bt-glance__badge-ring" cx="20" cy="20" r="15.5" />
                          <text x="20" y="23.4" text-anchor="middle">CTFL</text>
                        </svg>
                      </span>
                    )}
                  </dd>
                </div>
              ))}
            </dl>
            <p class="bt-glance__note">{c.glanceNote}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bt-stages">
          <div class="bt-stages__head">
            <h3>{c.showcaseStagesLabel}</h3>
          </div>
          <ol>
            {bt.seminar.etappen.map(([from, to], index) => (
              <li style={`--i:${index}`}>
                <span class="bt-num">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <p class="bt-stages__range">{c.stageRange(from, to)}</p>
                <h4>{c.showcaseStages[index][0]}</h4>
                <p>{c.showcaseStages[index][1]}</p>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================== CALENDAR -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-calendar" id="termine" aria-labelledby="bt-calendar-title">
    <div class="container bt-calendar__grid">
      <div class="bt-calendar__copy" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.calEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-calendar-title"><span>{c.calLead(ns.jahr)}</span> {c.calRest}</h2>
        <p class="bt-calendar__text">{startSet ? c.calTextSet(formatDate(ns.datum)) : c.calTextPending}</p>
        <p class="bt-calendar__status"><span class="bt-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{c.calLast(ns.jahr)}</p>
        <Button href={`#${formAnchor}`}>{cta}</Button>
      </div>
      <div class:list={['bt-calendar__board', { 'is-pending': !startSet }]} data-reveal="right">
        <div class="bt-calendar__months" aria-hidden={startSet ? undefined : 'true'}>
          {calendarMonths.map((month) => (
            <table class="bt-cal">
              <caption>{month.label}</caption>
              <thead>
                <tr>{c.weekdays.map((day) => <th scope="col">{day}</th>)}</tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {month.weeks.map((week) => (
                  <tr>
                    {week.map((day) =>
                      day === month.startDay ? (
                        <td class="is-start"><span class="bt-sr">{c.calStart}: </span>{day}</td>
                      ) : (
                        <td>{day ?? ''}</td>
                      ),
                    )}
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          ))}
        </div>
        {!startSet && <p class="bt-calendar__pending"><span>{c.calPending}</span></p>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= ENTRY -->
  <section class="section bt-entry" aria-labelledby="bt-entry-title">
    <div class="bt-aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container bt-entry__grid">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal="left">
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.entryEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-entry-title"><span>{c.entryLead}</span> {c.entryRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.entryText}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-versus" data-reveal="right">
        <div class="bt-versus__card is-without">
          <h3><span class="bt-versus__icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span>{c.entryWithout[0]}</h3>
          <ul>{c.entryWithout[1].map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bt-versus__bridge" aria-hidden="true"><span>{c.entryBridge} ↓</span></div>
        <div class="bt-versus__card is-with bt-spot">
          <h3><span class="bt-versus__icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>{c.entryWith[0]}</h3>
          <ul>{c.entryWith[1].map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= GROUPS -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-groups" aria-labelledby="bt-groups-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="bt-groups-title"><span>{c.groupsLead}</span> {c.groupsRest}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-groups__grid">
        {c.groups.map(([title, text], index) => (
          <article class="bt-group bt-spot" data-reveal>
            <span class="bt-num">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="bt-groups__note" data-reveal>{c.groupsNote}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================== PROOF -->
  <section class="section surface-light bt-proof" id="zertifikat" aria-labelledby="bt-proof-title">
    <div class="container bt-proof__grid">
      <figure class:list={['bt-proof__visual', { 'has-doc': certPreview }]} data-reveal="zoom">
        {certPreview && (
          <a class="bt-proof__doc" href={certLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img
              src={certPreview}
              alt={c.certAlt}
              width={certificateHasSize ? bt.zertifikatBreite! : undefined}
              height={certificateHasSize ? bt.zertifikatHoehe! : undefined}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <span class="bt-proof__doc-hint">{c.certOpen} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </a>
        )}
        {showMark ? (
          <img class="bt-proof__mark" src={bt.zeichenDatei} alt={c.markAlt} width={bt.zeichenBreite ?? undefined} height={bt.zeichenHoehe ?? undefined} loading="lazy" />
        ) : (
          <div class:list={['bt-proof__seal', { 'is-stamp': certPreview }]} aria-hidden="true">
            <span>{c.proofSeal[0]}</span>
            <strong>✓</strong>
            <span>{c.proofSeal[1]}</span>
            <small>{c.proofSeal[2]}</small>
          </div>
        )}
        {certPreview && c.certCaption && <figcaption>{c.certCaption}</figcaption>}
      </figure>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.proofEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-proof-title"><span>{c.proofLead}</span> {c.proofRest}</h2>
        <p class="bt-proof__text">{c.proofText}</p>
        <dl class="bt-proof__list">
          <div><dt>{c.proofRows.provider}</dt><dd>{company.name}, {company.street}, {company.city}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{c.proofRows.course}</dt><dd>{c.factCourse}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{c.proofRows.duration}</dt><dd>{c.factDuration}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{c.proofRows.basis}</dt><dd>{c.factBasis}</dd></div>
          <div>
            <dt>{c.proofRows.body}</dt>
            <dd>
              {bt.fachkundigeStelle.name}, {bt.fachkundigeStelle.ort}<br />
              {bt.fachkundigeStelle.akkreditierung && <>{c.bodyAccredited(bt.fachkundigeStelle.akkreditierung)}<br /></>}
              <a href={bt.fachkundigeStelle.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{bt.fachkundigeStelle.urlLabel}</a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          {proofRows.map(([label, value]) => <div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>)}
          <div>
            <dt>{c.proofRows.contact}</dt>
            <dd><a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phone}</a><br /><a href={company.emailHref}>{company.email}</a></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        {hasCertificate && (
          <div class="bt-proof__actions">
            <Button href={bt.zertifikatDatei} target="_blank">{c.certPdf}</Button>
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================ WHY -->
  <section class="section bt-why" aria-labelledby="bt-why-title">
    <div class="container bt-why__grid">
      <div class="bt-why__copy" data-reveal="left">
        <h2 id="bt-why-title"><span>{c.whyLead}</span> {c.whyRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.whyText}</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="bt-why__facts" data-reveal="right">
        {c.whyFacts.map(([value, label]) => <div class="bt-spot"><dt>{value}</dt><dd>{label}</dd></div>)}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ FORMATS -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-formats" aria-labelledby="bt-formats-title">
    <div class="bt-aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.formatsEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-formats-title"><span>{c.formatsLead}</span> {c.formatsRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.formatsText}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-formats__grid">
        {formats.map((format) => (
          <article class="bt-format" data-reveal="zoom">
            <div class="bt-format__inner">
              <div class="bt-format__top">
                <span class="bt-new">{c.newBadge}</span>
                <span class="bt-format__tag">{c.formatTag[format]}</span>
              </div>
              <h3>{c.format[format]}</h3>
              <p class="bt-format__meta">{bt.seminar.tage} {c.showcaseDays} · {bt.seminar.titel}</p>
              <ul>{c.formatPoints[format].map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>
              {approved && <p class="bt-format__status">{c.fundingNote}</p>}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      {approved && (
        <div class="bt-approved" data-reveal>
          <p>{c.coursesNoteApproved}</p>
          <div class="bt-approved__grid">
            {bt.massnahmen.map((m) => (
              <article class="bt-card">
                <p class="bt-card__eyebrow">{c.format[m.format]} · {m.dauer}</p>
                <h3>{m.name}</h3>
                <dl class="bt-approved__facts">
                  <div><dt>{c.measureNumber}</dt><dd>{m.massnahmenummer}</dd></div>
                  <div><dt>{c.place}</dt><dd>{m.ort}</dd></div>
                  <div><dt>{c.degree}</dt><dd>{m.abschluss}</dd></div>
                </dl>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
      <div class="bt-center" data-reveal>
        <Button href={`#${formAnchor}`} size="lg">{cta}</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ FUNDING -->
  <section class="section bt-fund" aria-labelledby="bt-fund-title">
    <div class="container bt-fund__grid">
      <div class="bt-fund__copy" data-reveal="left">
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.fundEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-fund-title"><span>{c.fundLead}</span> {c.fundRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.fundText}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-fund__tiles">
        {(approved ? c.fundTilesApproved : c.fundTiles).map(([state, status, title, text]) => (
          <article class:list={['bt-fund__tile', { 'is-open': state === 'open' }]} data-reveal="right">
            <span class="bt-fund__check" aria-hidden="true">{state === 'open' ? '' : '✓'}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="bt-fund__status">{status}</p>
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{text}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="bt-fund__note" data-reveal>{c.fundNote}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================== STEPS -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-steps" aria-labelledby="bt-steps-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="bt-steps-title"><span>{c.stepsLead}</span> {c.stepsRest}</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="bt-steps__list">
        {c.steps.map(([title, text], index) => (
          <li data-reveal>
            <span class="bt-num">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{text}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================== TRAINERS -->
  <section class="section bt-trainers" aria-labelledby="bt-trainers-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.trainersEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-trainers-title"><span>{c.trainersLead}</span> {c.trainersRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.trainersText}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-trainers__grid">
        {c.trainers.map((trainer) => (
          <details class="bt-trainer" data-reveal>
            <summary>
              <span class="bt-trainer__photo">
                <img src={trainerImages[trainer.key].src} alt={trainer.alt} width={trainerImages[trainer.key].size} height={trainerImages[trainer.key].size} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              </span>
              <h3>{trainer.name}</h3>
              <span class="bt-trainer__toggle">
                <span class="bt-trainer__open">{c.trainerOpen}</span>
                <span class="bt-trainer__close">{c.trainerClose}</span>
                <span class="bt-trainer__chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="bt-trainer__body">
              <p class="bt-trainer__role">{trainer.role}</p>
              {trainer.groups.map(([label, items]) => (
                <div class="bt-trainer__group">
                  <h4>{label}</h4>
                  <ul>{items.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
                </div>
              ))}
              <a class="bt-trainer__source" href={trainerSource} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{c.trainerSource}</a>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ KNOW-HOW -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-know" aria-labelledby="bt-know-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{c.knowEyebrow}</p>
        <h2 id="bt-know-title"><span>{c.knowLead}</span> {c.knowRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.knowText}</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="bt-kpis" aria-label={c.kpiLabel}>
        {c.kpis.map(([value, suffix, label]) => (
          <li class="bt-spot" data-reveal>
            <strong data-count-to={value} data-count-suffix={suffix}>{numberFormat.format(value as number)}{suffix}</strong>
            <span>{label}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <div class="bt-tiles">
        {c.knowTiles.map(([title, text], index) => (
          <article class="bt-tile bt-spot" data-reveal>
            <span class="bt-num">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ SECTORS -->
  <section class="section bt-sectors" aria-labelledby="bt-sectors-title" data-sectors>
    <div class="bt-sectors__floor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container bt-sectors__inner">
      <div class="bt-sectors__head">
        <div class="bt-head" data-reveal="left">
          <p class="eyebrow">{c.sectorsEyebrow}</p>
          <h2 id="bt-sectors-title"><span>{c.sectorsLead}</span> {c.sectorsRest}</h2>
          <p>{c.sectorsText}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bt-sectors__facts" data-reveal="right">
          <ul class="bt-sectors__stats">
            {sectorStats.map(([value, suffix, label]) => (
              <li>
                <strong data-count-to={value} data-count-suffix={suffix}>{value}{suffix}</strong>
                <span>{label}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div class="bt-sectors__countries">
            <p>{c.sectorsCountries}</p>
            <ul>
              {projectCountries.map((code) => <li><span aria-hidden="true">{code}</span>{regionNames.of(code)}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bt-explorer" data-reveal>
        <div class="bt-orbit" data-orbit>
          <svg class="bt-orbit__svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 800" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <ellipse class="bt-orbit__ring bt-orbit__ring--outer" cx="500" cy="400" rx="300" ry="320" />
            <circle class="bt-orbit__ring bt-orbit__ring--mid" cx="500" cy="400" r="220" />
            <circle class="bt-orbit__ring bt-orbit__ring--inner" cx="500" cy="400" r="140" />
            <g class="bt-orbit__spin">{sparks(220, 5).map((dot) => <circle class="bt-orbit__spark" cx={dot.cx} cy={dot.cy} r="4" />)}</g>
            <g class="bt-orbit__spin bt-orbit__spin--rev">{sparks(140, 3).map((dot) => <circle class="bt-orbit__spark" cx={dot.cx} cy={dot.cy} r="3" />)}</g>
            {orbitNodes.map((node, i) => (
              <line class:list={['bt-orbit__beam', { 'is-active': i === 0 }]} x1="500" y1="400" x2={node.sx} y2={node.sy} data-sector-beam />
            ))}
          </svg>
          <div class="bt-orbit__core" aria-hidden="true">
            <strong>WAMOCON</strong>
            <span>{c.sectorsCore}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bt-orbit__nodes" role="tablist" aria-label={c.sectorsTabsLabel}>
            {orbitNodes.map((node, i) => (
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                id={`bt-sector-tab-${node.key}`}
                aria-controls={`bt-sector-${node.key}`}
                aria-selected={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
                tabindex={i === 0 ? 0 : -1}
                class:list={['bt-orbit__node', `is-${node.side}`, { 'is-active': i === 0 }]}
                style={`--x:${node.x}%;--y:${node.y}%;--i:${i}`}
                data-sector-tab
              >
                <span class="bt-orbit__dot" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={sectorIcons[node.icon]} />
                </span>
                <span class="bt-orbit__label">{node.name[lang]}</span>
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bt-explorer__side">
          <p class="bt-explorer__hint">{c.sectorsHint}</p>
          <div class="bt-explorer__stack">
            {sectors.map((sector, i) => (
              <article
                role="tabpanel"
                id={`bt-sector-${sector.key}`}
                aria-labelledby={`bt-sector-tab-${sector.key}`}
                class:list={['bt-sector', { 'is-active': i === 0 }]}
                tabindex="0"
                data-sector-panel
              >
                <div class="bt-sector__top">
                  <span class="bt-sector__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={sectorIcons[sector.icon]} />
                  </span>
                  <span class="bt-sector__count">{pad2(i + 1)} / {pad2(sectors.length)}</span>
                </div>
                <svg class="bt-sector__mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" set:html={sectorIcons[sector.icon]} />
                <h3>{sector.name[lang]}</h3>
                <p class="bt-sector__label">{c.refsLabel}</p>
                <ul class="bt-sector__refs">{sector.refs.map((ref) => <li>{ref}</li>)}</ul>
                {sector.projects?.map((project) => (
                  <div class="bt-sector__project">
                    <p class="bt-sector__label">{c.projectLabel}{project.year ? ` · ${project.year[lang]}` : ''}</p>
                    <p>{project.text[lang]}</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="bt-explorer__progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-sector-progress></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bt-refs" data-reveal>
        <p class="bt-refs__label">{c.refsMarquee}</p>
        <div class="bt-refs__track">
          <ul>{allRefs.map((name) => <li>{name}</li>)}</ul>
          <ul aria-hidden="true">{allRefs.map((name) => <li>{name}</li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bt-refs__track bt-refs__track--rev" aria-hidden="true">
          <ul>{[...allRefs].reverse().map((name) => <li>{name}</li>)}</ul>
          <ul>{[...allRefs].reverse().map((name) => <li>{name}</li>)}</ul>
        </div>
        <p class="bt-refs__source">{c.sectorsSource}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================================================== COMPARE -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-compare" aria-labelledby="bt-compare-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="bt-compare-title"><span>{c.compareLead}</span> {c.compareRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.compareText}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-compare__wrap" data-reveal>
        <table class="bt-compare__table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <td></td>
              {c.compareCols.map((col, index) => <th scope="col" class:list={{ 'is-ours': index === 0 }}>{col}</th>)}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {c.compareRows.map(([label, ...cells]) => (
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">{label}</th>
                {cells.map((cell, index) => (
                  <td class:list={{ 'is-ours': index === 0 }}>
                    {cell === 'yes' ? (
                      <span class="bt-mark bt-mark--yes"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="bt-sr">{c.compareYes}</span></span>
                    ) : cell === 'no' ? (
                      <span class="bt-mark bt-mark--no"><span aria-hidden="true">×</span><span class="bt-sr">{c.compareNo}</span></span>
                    ) : (
                      cell
                    )}
                  </td>
                ))}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ SUPPORT -->
  <section class="section bt-support" aria-labelledby="bt-support-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bt-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="bt-support-title"><span>{c.supportLead}</span> {c.supportRest}</h2>
        <p>{c.supportIntro}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bt-cards">
        {c.support.map(([title, text], index) => (
          <article class:list={['bt-card', 'bt-spot', { 'bt-card--feature': index === c.support.length - 1 }]} data-reveal>
            <span class="bt-num">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <div>
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{text}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====================================================== FUNDING CHECK -->
  <section class="section bt-alt bt-check" aria-labelledby="bt-quiz-title">
    <div class="bt-aurora" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="container">
      <form class="bt-quiz" data-bt-quiz data-reveal aria-labelledby="bt-quiz-title">
        <div class="bt-quiz__head">
          <p class="eyebrow">{c.quizEyebrow}</p>
          <h2 id="bt-quiz-title"><span>{c.quizLead}</span> {c.quizRest}</h2>
          <p>{c.quizText}</p>
          <p class="bt-quiz__note">{c.quizNote}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bt-quiz__body" data-bt-quiz-body>
          <div class="bt-quiz__questions" data-bt-quiz-questions>
          {c.quizQuestions.map((question, qi) => (
            <fieldset>
              <legend><span class="bt-quiz__step" aria-hidden="true">{qi + 1}</span>{question.label}</legend>
              <div class:list={['bt-quiz__options', { 'is-pair': question.options.length === 2 }]}>
                {question.options.map(([value, label]) => (
                  <label>
                    <input type="radio" name={question.name} value={value} required />
                    <span>{label}</span>
                  </label>
                ))}
              </div>
            </fieldset>
          ))}
          <button type="submit" class="bt-quiz__submit">{c.quizSubmit} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="bt-quiz__result" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden data-bt-quiz-result>
            <p class="bt-quiz__result-label">{c.quizResultLabel}</p>
            {Object.entries(c.quizResults).map(([key, [title, text]]) => (
              <div data-result={key} hidden>
                <strong>{title}</strong>
                <p>{text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
            <div class="bt-quiz__result-actions">
              <Button href={`#${formAnchor}`}>{cta}</Button>
              <button type="button" class="bt-quiz__back" data-bt-quiz-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> {c.quizBack}</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FaqSection
    heading={c.faqHeading}
    intro={c.faqIntro}
    items={faq}
    lang={lang}
    bylineName={bt.pruefer}
    bylineRole={c.bylineRole}
    lastReviewed={bt.pruefdatum || undefined}
  />

  <LeadForm
    lang={lang}
    type="bildungstraeger"
    title={cta}
    intro={approved ? c.formIntroApproved : c.formIntroPlanned}
    anchorId={formAnchor}
  />
</div>

<style>
  /* Tokens only. Section rhythm, card surfaces and type follow the home page,
     the About page and the course catalogue. This page carries more motion
     than the others on purpose (team feedback); every animation is transform
     or opacity based and switches off under prefers-reduced-motion. */
  .bt-page { position: relative; background: var(--color-bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .bt-page ol { list-style: none; }
  /* Alternating section surface, set per section in the markup. */
  .bt-alt { background: var(--color-bg-elevated); }
  .bt-sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }

  /* ---- Shared bits ---------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-new {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-accent-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: var(--fs-2xs);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent);
    animation: bt-pulse 2.6s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .bt-num {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(42px, 2.6vw, 52px);
    height: clamp(42px, 2.6vw, 52px);
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-accent-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent);
  }
  .bt-head { max-width: 1100px; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem); }
  .bt-head h2 { margin: 0.8rem 0 0; font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-head h2 span { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-head > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 68ch; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-center { margin-top: clamp(32px, 3vw, 48px); }

  /* Aurora: slow drifting red light, the page's "living" background. */
  .bt-aurora { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-aurora span {
    position: absolute;
    width: 60vmax;
    height: 60vmax;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow-top), transparent 62%);
    animation: bt-drift 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .bt-aurora span:first-child { top: -30%; left: -20%; }
  .bt-aurora span:last-child { right: -25%; bottom: -35%; background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow-side), transparent 60%); animation-duration: 28s; animation-direction: alternate-reverse; }

  /* ---- Hero (pattern: AcademyHome full-bleed hero) -------------------------- */
  /* minmax(0, 1fr): without it the long word "Softwaretester" sets the grid
     column's minimum width and pushes the whole copy past a phone screen. */
  .bt-hero { position: relative; display: grid; min-height: 100svh; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: end; overflow: hidden; }
  .bt-hero__media, .bt-hero__overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .bt-hero__media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; animation: bt-kenburns 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  .bt-hero__overlay {
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.84) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.58) 55%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.36) 100%),
      linear-gradient(0deg, var(--color-bg) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 40%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 100%);
  }
  .bt-hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-block: clamp(140px, 19vh, 210px) clamp(40px, 6vh, 88px); }
  .bt-hero__copy { max-width: 1100px; }
  .bt-hero__badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .bt-hero__kicker { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-hero__kicker img { width: auto; height: auto; max-height: 48px; }
  .bt-hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: var(--fs-hero); line-height: var(--lh-display); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); }
  .bt-hero h1 span { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-hero__trust { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .bt-hero__trust li > * { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0.45rem 1rem 0.45rem 0.7rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: rgba(16, 16, 16, 0.6); font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-snug); transition: border-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-hero__trust a:hover, .bt-hero__trust a:focus-visible { border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-hero__trust svg { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-hero__trust strong { font-weight: var(--fw-bold); }
  .bt-hero__lead { max-width: 54ch; font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-sm); margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .bt-hero__note { max-width: 80ch; margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-text-subtle); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: var(--lh-body); }

  /* ---- Seals ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .bt-seals { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding-block: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg); }
  .bt-seals__list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 24px); }
  /* Seal cards are centred (team request), unlike the left-aligned page. */
  .bt-seal {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 22px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface-card);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .bt-seal:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--shadow-accent); }
  /* Every seal shares one visual height, so medals and logos line up. */
  .bt-seal__visual { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 96px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .bt-seal__visual img { width: auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 96px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
  .bt-seal__visual .bt-seal__logo { width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 50%; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(212, 18, 67, 0.35)); }
  /* Google rating: a large score over five solid stars. */
  .bt-rating { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .bt-rating__value { color: var(--color-text); font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bt-rating__stars { display: flex; gap: 3px; }
  .bt-rating__stars svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: var(--color-star); filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(251, 188, 4, 0.35)); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 40ms); }
  .bt-seal:hover .bt-rating__stars svg { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.08); }
  .bt-seal strong { color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-seal__text { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-seal__link { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; border-radius: inherit; }
  .bt-seal__link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .bt-medal { width: 96px; height: 96px; overflow: visible; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.28)); }
  .bt-medal__outer { fill: var(--color-bg-elevated); stroke: var(--color-accent); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bt-medal__dash { fill: none; stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-dasharray: 1.5 2.5; }
  .bt-medal__ring { transform-box: view-box; transform-origin: 60px 60px; }
  .bt-seal:hover .bt-medal__ring { animation: bt-spin 14s linear infinite; }
  .bt-medal__ring text { fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 7.6px; font-weight: var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .bt-medal__core { fill: var(--color-accent-surface); stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bt-medal__main { fill: var(--color-text); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .bt-medal__sub { fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .bt-seal.has-link strong::after { content: ' ↗'; color: var(--color-accent); }

  /* ---- Showcase ------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-showcase { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding-block: 0 var(--space-lg); }
  .bt-showcase__panel {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 56px);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 64px);
    /* A light runs around the border: a conic gradient on the border box. */
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--color-bg-elevated), var(--color-bg-elevated)) padding-box,
      conic-gradient(from var(--bt-angle), var(--color-accent-surface), rgba(212, 0, 0, 0.18) 25%, var(--color-signal) 50%, rgba(212, 0, 0, 0.18) 75%, var(--color-accent-surface)) border-box;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--shadow-accent);
    animation: bt-angle 10s linear infinite;
  }
  .bt-showcase__top, .bt-stages { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .bt-signal { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-signal), var(--color-signal-soft)); color: var(--color-text-dark); font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; animation: bt-signal 2.6s var(--ease-out) infinite; }
  .bt-signal::before { content: ''; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-text-dark); }
  .bt-signal::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55) 50%, transparent 70%); background-size: 250% 100%; animation: bt-sweep 4.5s ease-in-out infinite; pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-showcase__top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: stretch; }
  .bt-showcase__eyebrow { display: flex; }
  .bt-showcase__days { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-xs); margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-showcase__days strong { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-display); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); line-height: var(--lh-display); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); }
  .bt-showcase__days span { font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-showcase h2 { margin-top: var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--fs-h2); }
  .bt-showcase__sub { margin-top: var(--space-sm); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-showcase__text { max-width: 62ch; margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-muted); }
  /* The glance box stretches to the intro's height; its rows spread evenly. */
  .bt-glance { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 32px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); }
  .bt-glance h3, .bt-stages h3 { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-glance h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-glance dl { display: grid; flex: 1; align-content: space-evenly; }
  .bt-glance div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, 0.45fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-sm); padding-block: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
  .bt-glance div:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  .bt-glance dt { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-glance dd { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 4px 10px; font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-glance__badge { display: inline-grid; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .bt-glance__badge svg { width: 34px; height: 34px; filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(29, 79, 145, 0.55)); }
  .bt-glance__badge-bg { fill: var(--color-blue); }
  .bt-glance__badge-ring { fill: none; stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 1.5 2; }
  .bt-glance__badge text { fill: var(--color-text); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .bt-glance div.is-price { margin-inline: calc(var(--space-sm) * -1); padding-inline: var(--space-sm); border-top-color: transparent; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.12); }
  .bt-glance div.is-price + div { border-top-color: transparent; }
  .bt-glance__price { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); line-height: 1; }
  .is-regular .bt-glance__price { color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--fs-h5); }
  .bt-glance__small { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }
  .bt-glance__note { margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-text-subtle); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-stages__head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-stages ol { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-stages li { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; padding: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 24px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-stages li:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  /* A short connector bridges the gap to the next stage, level with the number. */
  .bt-stages li:not(:last-child)::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: calc(clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 24px) + clamp(21px, 1.3vw, 26px)); left: 100%; width: var(--space-sm); height: 2px; background: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-stages .bt-num { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .bt-stages p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-stages .bt-stages__range { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-stages h4 { font-size: var(--fs-h4); }
  /* The four stages light up one after another, like a path through the seminar. */
  .bt-stages li { animation: bt-stage 8s var(--ease-out) infinite; animation-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 2s); }
  .bt-stages li:not(:last-child)::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent-surface), var(--color-signal), var(--color-accent-surface)); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: bt-flow 2.4s linear infinite; }
  /* Status and CTA close the intro column; the CTA sits at its foot so both
     columns end on the same line. */
  .bt-showcase__intro { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .bt-showcase__cta { margin-top: auto; padding-top: var(--space-md); }
  .bt-showcase__status { margin-top: var(--space-md); max-width: 62ch; padding-left: var(--space-sm); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }

  /* ---- Calendar --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-calendar__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .bt-calendar__copy h2 { margin-top: var(--space-sm); font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-calendar__copy h2 span { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-calendar__text { max-width: 56ch; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-calendar__status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-block: var(--space-md); color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-dot { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent); animation: bt-ping 1.8s ease-out infinite; }
  .bt-calendar__board { position: relative; padding: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 36px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
  .bt-calendar__months { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-md); }
  .bt-cal { width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 4px; text-align: center; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bt-cal caption { padding: 0 4px var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--fs-h5); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); text-align: left; }
  .bt-cal th { padding-bottom: 4px; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-cal td { height: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-cal td:empty { background: transparent; }
  .bt-cal td.is-start { background: var(--color-accent-surface); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent); }
  .is-pending .bt-cal { opacity: 0.35; filter: grayscale(1); }
  .bt-calendar__pending { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: var(--space-sm); pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-calendar__pending span { padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-surface); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--color-bg); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent); animation: bt-float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }

  /* ---- Formats: the "wow" block. A light beam runs around each card border. */
  .bt-formats { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .bt-formats .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .bt-formats__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 40px); }
  .bt-format { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 2px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
  .bt-format::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 200%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg 250deg, var(--color-accent) 320deg, transparent 360deg);
    translate: -50% -50%;
    animation: bt-spin 6s linear infinite;
  }
  .bt-format:nth-child(2)::before { animation-delay: -3s; }
  .bt-format__inner { position: relative; height: 100%; padding: clamp(28px, 3vw, 48px); border-radius: calc(var(--radius-lg) - 2px); background: var(--surface-card); transition: background var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-format:hover .bt-format__inner { background: var(--surface-card-hover); }
  .bt-format__top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-xs); }
  .bt-format__tag { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-format h3 { margin-top: var(--space-md); font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-format__meta { margin-top: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-format ul { display: grid; gap: var(--space-xs); margin-top: var(--space-md); }
  .bt-format li { position: relative; padding-left: 28px; }
  .bt-format li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; top: 0.1em; left: 0; display: grid; width: 18px; height: 18px; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--color-accent-surface); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); }
  .bt-format__status { margin-top: var(--space-md); padding-top: var(--space-sm); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-approved { margin-top: var(--space-lg); }
  .bt-approved__grid .bt-card { display: block; }
  .bt-approved__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-md); margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-approved__facts { display: grid; gap: 4px; margin-top: var(--space-sm); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-approved__facts div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 var(--space-xs); }
  .bt-approved__facts dt { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .bt-approved__facts dt::after { content: ':'; }

  /* ---- Know-how ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 24px); margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 3vw, 56px); }
  .bt-kpis li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-xs); padding: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 28px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
  .bt-kpis strong { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .bt-kpis span { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(20px, 2vw, 32px); }
  .bt-tile { grid-column: span 2; }
  .bt-tile:nth-child(n + 4) { grid-column: span 3; }
  .bt-tile { padding: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 40px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), background var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--surface-card-hover); }
  .bt-tile h3 { margin-block: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--fs-h4); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-tile p { color: var(--color-muted); }

  /* ---- Funding --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-fund__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .bt-fund__copy h2 { margin-top: var(--space-sm); font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); }
  .bt-fund__copy h2 span { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-fund__copy > p:last-child { max-width: 52ch; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-fund__tiles { display: grid; gap: var(--space-md); }
  .bt-fund__tile { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); padding: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 32px); border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-surface); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
  .bt-fund__tile.is-open { border-color: var(--border-strong); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035); }
  .bt-fund__check { display: grid; flex: 0 0 auto; width: 48px; height: 48px; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--color-accent-surface); font-size: var(--fs-h4); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent); }
  .is-open .bt-fund__check { border: 2px dashed var(--color-accent); background: transparent; box-shadow: none; animation: bt-spin 8s linear infinite; }
  .bt-fund__status { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-fund__tile h3 { margin-top: 4px; font-size: var(--fs-h4); }
  .bt-fund__tile p:last-child { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-fund__note { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 100ch; color: var(--color-text-subtle); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: var(--lh-body); }

  /* ---- Steps (pattern: AcademyHome .steps__list) ----------------------------- */
  .bt-steps__list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(28px, 2.7vw, 46px); }
  .bt-steps__list li { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(12px, 1vw, 18px); padding: clamp(22px, 1.8vw, 34px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-steps__list li:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-steps__list li::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; top: 50%; right: clamp(-30px, -1.7vw, -18px); transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-h4); line-height: 1; pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-steps__list li:last-child::after { content: none; }
  .bt-steps__list h3 { font-size: var(--fs-h4); }
  .bt-steps__list p { color: var(--color-muted); }

  /* ---- Trainers ------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-trainers__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); align-items: start; gap: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 40px); }
  .bt-trainer { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-trainer:hover, .bt-trainer[open] { border-color: var(--color-accent-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--shadow-accent); }
  .bt-trainer summary { display: grid; grid-template-columns: clamp(96px, 9vw, 140px) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-rows: auto auto; align-items: center; gap: 4px clamp(16px, 2vw, 32px); padding: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 24px); cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
  .bt-trainer summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .bt-trainer summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: -4px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
  .bt-trainer__photo { grid-row: 1 / 3; display: block; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface-soft); }
  .bt-trainer__photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform var(--dur-slow) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-trainer:hover .bt-trainer__photo img { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .bt-trainer h3 { align-self: end; font-size: var(--fs-h3); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-trainer__toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-xs); align-self: start; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-trainer__close, .bt-trainer[open] .bt-trainer__open { display: none; }
  .bt-trainer[open] .bt-trainer__close { display: inline; }
  .bt-trainer__chev { width: 0.55em; height: 0.55em; border-right: 2px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; transform: translateY(-25%) rotate(45deg); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-trainer[open] .bt-trainer__chev { transform: translateY(25%) rotate(-135deg); }
  .bt-trainer__body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-sm); padding: 0 clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 24px) clamp(20px, 2vw, 32px); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); animation: bt-pop var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-trainer__role { padding-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-text); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-trainer__group h4 { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-trainer ul { display: grid; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .bt-trainer li { position: relative; padding-left: 22px; color: var(--color-muted); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-trainer li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0.5em; left: 0; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--color-accent-surface); }
  .bt-trainer__source { justify-self: start; color: var(--color-text-subtle); font-size: var(--fs-xs); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  .bt-trainer__source:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }

  /* ---- Support -------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(20px, 2vw, 32px); }
  .bt-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm); padding: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 40px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-cards > .bt-card { grid-column: span 2; }
  .bt-cards > .bt-card:nth-child(4), .bt-cards > .bt-card:nth-child(5) { grid-column: span 3; }
  .bt-cards > .bt-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-card h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--fs-h4); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-card p { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .bt-card .bt-card__eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-cards > .bt-card--feature { grid-column: 1 / -1; flex-direction: row; align-items: flex-start; border-color: var(--color-accent-surface); background: radial-gradient(70% 120% at 0% 0%, var(--glow-top), transparent 70%), var(--surface-card); }
  .bt-card--feature h3 { font-size: var(--fs-h3); }
  .bt-card--feature p { max-width: 90ch; color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }

  /* ---- Why + industry network --------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-why__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .bt-why__copy h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-why__copy h2 span { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-why__copy > p { max-width: 56ch; margin-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-why__facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-why__facts div { padding: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 28px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface-card); transition: border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-why__facts div:hover { border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-why__facts div:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-color: var(--color-accent-surface); background: radial-gradient(80% 140% at 0% 0%, var(--glow-top), transparent 70%), var(--surface-card); }
  .bt-why__facts div:first-child dt { font-size: var(--fs-h1); }
  .bt-why__facts dt { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); line-height: 1.1; }
  .bt-why__facts dd { margin-top: 4px; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }

  /* ---- Industry explorer: the "wow" block ------------------------------------------
     A perspective grid moves under the section, rings and sparks circle the
     WAMOCON core and a beam points at the selected industry. */
  .bt-sectors { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(60% 50% at 30% 55%, var(--glow-top), transparent 70%), var(--color-bg); }
  .bt-sectors__floor {
    position: absolute;
    left: -30%;
    right: -30%;
    bottom: -20%;
    height: 70%;
    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.24) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.24) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    transform: perspective(520px) rotateX(64deg);
    transform-origin: center bottom;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000 5%, transparent 80%);
    animation: bt-floor 5s linear infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bt-sectors__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .bt-sectors__head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); align-items: end; margin-bottom: clamp(24px, 3vw, 48px); }
  .bt-sectors__head .bt-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .bt-sectors__head h2 { font-size: var(--fs-display); line-height: var(--lh-display); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); }
  .bt-sectors__facts { display: grid; gap: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-sectors__countries { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-sectors__countries p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-sectors__countries ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .bt-sectors__countries li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 4px 12px 4px 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-sectors__countries li span { display: grid; min-width: 30px; height: 24px; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--color-accent-surface); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .bt-sectors__stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-sectors__stats li { padding: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 24px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface-card); }
  .bt-sectors__stats strong { display: block; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bt-sectors__stats span { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }

  .bt-explorer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.75fr); gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem); align-items: center; }
  /* The tilt only applies while the pointer is on the orbit; a permanent 3D
     transform would rasterise the labels and make them look soft. */
  .bt-orbit { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 5 / 4; margin-block: 40px; transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-orbit.is-tilting { transform: perspective(1400px) rotateX(var(--rx, 0deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 0deg)); }
  .bt-orbit__svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
  .bt-orbit__ring { fill: none; stroke: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-orbit__ring--outer { stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 2 12; opacity: 0.55; animation: bt-dash 3s linear infinite; }
  .bt-orbit__ring--mid { stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 1 10; opacity: 0.35; }
  .bt-orbit__ring--inner { stroke-width: 1; opacity: 0.2; }
  .bt-orbit__spin { transform-box: view-box; transform-origin: 500px 400px; animation: bt-spin 26s linear infinite; }
  .bt-orbit__spin--rev { animation-duration: 18s; animation-direction: reverse; }
  .bt-orbit__spark { fill: var(--color-accent); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--color-accent)); }
  .bt-orbit__beam { stroke: var(--color-accent); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 9; opacity: 0.18; transition: opacity var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-orbit__beam.is-active { stroke-width: 3; opacity: 1; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px var(--color-accent)); animation: bt-dash 1.2s linear infinite; }
  .bt-orbit__core {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    display: grid;
    width: 22%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, var(--color-accent), var(--color-accent-surface) 60%, #5c0505 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.12), 0 0 80px rgba(244, 14, 14, 0.55);
    text-align: center;
    translate: -50% -50%;
    animation: bt-pulse 3.2s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .bt-orbit__core strong { font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem); font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .bt-orbit__core span { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); }
  .bt-orbit__nodes { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .bt-orbit__node { position: absolute; top: var(--y); left: var(--x); width: 52px; height: 52px; margin: -26px 0 0 -26px; padding: 0; border-radius: 50%; color: var(--color-text); cursor: pointer; }
  .bt-orbit__dot { display: grid; width: 100%; height: 100%; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-bg-elevated); color: var(--color-muted); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), background var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-orbit__dot svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .bt-orbit__label { position: absolute; width: max-content; max-width: 132px; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); line-height: var(--lh-snug); transition: color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-r .bt-orbit__label { top: 50%; left: calc(100% + 10px); translate: 0 -50%; text-align: left; }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-l .bt-orbit__label { top: 50%; right: calc(100% + 10px); translate: 0 -50%; text-align: right; }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-t .bt-orbit__label { bottom: calc(100% + 8px); left: 50%; translate: -50% 0; text-align: center; }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-b .bt-orbit__label { top: calc(100% + 8px); left: 50%; translate: -50% 0; text-align: center; }
  .bt-orbit__node:hover .bt-orbit__dot { border-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-text); transform: scale(1.08); }
  .bt-orbit__node:hover .bt-orbit__label { color: var(--color-text); }
  .bt-orbit__node:focus-visible { outline: none; }
  .bt-orbit__node:focus-visible .bt-orbit__dot { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-active .bt-orbit__dot { border-color: var(--color-accent-surface); background: var(--color-accent-surface); color: var(--color-text); transform: scale(1.2); animation: bt-pulse 2.4s var(--ease-out) infinite; }
  .bt-orbit__node.is-active .bt-orbit__label { color: var(--color-text); }

  .bt-explorer__side { display: grid; gap: var(--space-sm); }
  .bt-explorer__hint { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  /* All panels share one grid cell: the box is as tall as the longest panel,
     so switching industries never moves the page. */
  .bt-explorer__stack { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .bt-sector {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    padding: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 40px);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: radial-gradient(90% 80% at 100% 0%, var(--glow-top), transparent 70%), var(--surface-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--shadow-accent);
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.98);
    transition: opacity var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), visibility var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out);
  }
  .bt-sector.is-active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: none; }
  /* A large faded copy of the industry icon fills the lower corner. */
  .bt-sector__mark { position: absolute; right: -24px; bottom: -24px; width: clamp(140px, 14vw, 210px); height: auto; color: var(--color-text); opacity: 0.06; pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-sector > :not(.bt-sector__mark) { position: relative; }
  .bt-sector:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .bt-sector__top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
  .bt-sector__icon { display: grid; width: 56px; height: 56px; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-accent-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent); }
  .bt-sector__icon svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
  .bt-sector__count { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .bt-sector h3 { font-size: var(--fs-h2); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-sector__label { margin-top: var(--space-xs); color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--fs-2xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-sector__refs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .bt-sector__refs li { overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); }
  .bt-sector__project { margin-top: var(--space-xs); padding-left: var(--space-sm); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-sector__project .bt-sector__label { margin-top: 0; }
  .bt-sector__project p:last-child { margin-top: 4px; color: var(--color-text); line-height: var(--lh-snug); }
  .bt-explorer__progress { height: 3px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: var(--border-subtle); opacity: 0; transition: opacity var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-explorer__progress span { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: var(--color-accent); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; }
  .is-playing .bt-explorer__progress { opacity: 1; }
  .is-playing .bt-explorer__progress span { animation: bt-fill 5s linear forwards; }

  .bt-refs { margin-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px); }
  .bt-refs__label { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-xs); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-refs__track { display: flex; overflow: hidden; padding-block: 6px; mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 10%, #000 90%, transparent); }
  .bt-refs__track ul { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 72px); padding-right: clamp(32px, 4vw, 72px); animation: bt-marquee 60s linear infinite; }
  .bt-refs__track--rev ul { animation-direction: reverse; animation-duration: 70s; }
  .bt-refs__track li { font-size: var(--fs-h3); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0.9; }
  .bt-refs__track--rev li { color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); }
  .bt-refs__track:hover ul { animation-play-state: paused; }
  .bt-refs__source { margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-text-subtle); font-size: var(--fs-xs); }

  /* ---- Proof: quality seal on a light surface ---------------------------------- */
  .bt-proof__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.62fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: start; }
  .bt-proof__visual { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-md)); display: grid; justify-items: center; max-width: 460px; margin: 0; }
  /* The certificate as a sheet of paper, slightly turned; it straightens on
     hover and opens the full certificate. */
  .bt-proof__doc {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 70px -30px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55), 0 0 0 1px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
    transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-out), box-shadow 0.6s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .bt-proof__doc::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55) 50%, transparent 65%); background-size: 250% 100%; background-position: 120% 0; transition: background-position 1s var(--ease-out); pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-proof__doc:hover, .bt-proof__doc:focus-visible { transform: none; box-shadow: 0 50px 90px -30px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08); }
  .bt-proof__doc:hover::after { background-position: -40% 0; }
  .bt-proof__doc:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-accent-surface); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .bt-proof__doc img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .bt-proof__doc-hint { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 16px; z-index: 1; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-pill); background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.88); color: #fff; font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-semibold); white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; translate: -50% 8px; transition: opacity var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), translate var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-proof__doc:hover .bt-proof__doc-hint, .bt-proof__doc:focus-visible .bt-proof__doc-hint { opacity: 1; translate: -50% 0; }
  .bt-proof__visual figcaption { margin-top: var(--space-md); color: var(--color-muted-dark); font-size: var(--fs-xs); text-align: left; justify-self: start; }
  .bt-proof__seal {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    width: min(100%, 300px);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 18%;
    border: 6px double var(--color-accent-surface);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-surface) 55%, var(--color-surface-soft) 100%);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.45);
  }
  .bt-proof__seal::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 14px; border: 1px dashed var(--color-accent-surface); border-radius: 50%; animation: bt-spin 40s linear infinite; }
  .bt-proof__seal span:first-child { color: var(--color-accent-surface); font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: var(--fw-extrabold); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); }
  .bt-proof__seal strong { display: grid; width: 48px; height: 48px; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent-surface); color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--fs-h4); }
  .bt-proof__seal span:nth-of-type(2) { font-size: var(--fs-xs); font-weight: var(--fw-bold); line-height: var(--lh-snug); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bt-proof__seal small { color: var(--color-muted-dark); font-size: var(--fs-xs); }
  .bt-proof__mark { width: auto; height: auto; max-height: 200px; }
  /* With the certificate shown, the seal becomes a stamp on its corner. */
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp { position: absolute; right: -36px; bottom: 56px; z-index: 2; width: 156px; height: 156px; aspect-ratio: auto; gap: 2px; padding: 0; border-width: 4px; rotate: -12deg; box-shadow: 0 18px 30px -12px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.5); }
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp::after { inset: 8px; }
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp span:first-child { font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp strong { width: 30px; height: 30px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp span:nth-of-type(2), .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp small { font-size: 0.58rem; }
  .bt-proof__seal.is-stamp span:nth-of-type(2) { max-width: 74%; }
  .bt-proof h2 { margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-text-dark); font-size: var(--fs-h1); line-height: var(--lh-tight); }
  .bt-proof h2 span { color: var(--color-accent-surface); }
  .bt-proof .eyebrow { color: var(--color-accent-surface); }
  .bt-proof__text { max-width: 60ch; margin-top: var(--space-sm); color: var(--color-muted-dark); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-proof__list { display: grid; margin-top: var(--space-md); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark); }
  .bt-proof__list div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(170px, 0.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md); padding-block: var(--space-sm); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark); }
  .bt-proof__list dt { color: var(--color-muted-dark); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .bt-proof__list dd { color: var(--color-text-dark); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }
  .bt-proof__list a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  .bt-proof__list a:hover { color: var(--color-accent-surface); }
  .bt-proof__actions { margin-top: var(--space-md); }

  /* ---- Groups --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-groups__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 40px); }
  .bt-group { padding: clamp(28px, 3vw, 48px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); transition: transform var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out); }
  .bt-group:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .bt-group h3 { margin-block: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--fs-h3); }
  .bt-group p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-lead); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); }
  .bt-groups__note { max-width: 90ch; margin-top: var(--space-md); color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }

  /* ---- Scroll progress and spotlight -------------------------------------------- */
  .bt-progress { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: calc(var(--z-header) + 1); height: 3px; pointer-events: none; }
  .bt-progress span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--color-accent); transform: scaleX(var(--p, 0)); transform-origin: left; box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent); }
  /* A soft red light follows the pointer across cards (set from the script). */
  .bt-spot { position: relative; isolation: isolate; }
  .bt-spot::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(420px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 50%), var(--glow-top), transparent 45%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--dur-med) var(--ease-out);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bt-spot:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

  /* Hero extras: a slowly moving dot grid and a light sweep across the accent line. */
  .bt-hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 28px 28px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #000, transparent 70%);
    animation: bt-grid 30s linear infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bt-hero h1 span {
    /* background-clip: text only paints inside the box. The padding gives
       descenders such as the "g" in "Tagen" room; the negative margin keeps
       the line spacing unchanged. */
    padding-bottom: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: -0.14em;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--color-accent) 0%, var(--color-accent) 42%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 50%, var(--color-accent) 58%, var(--color-accent) 100%);
    background-size: 250% 100%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    animation: bt-sheen 18s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* ---- Why software testing ------------------------------------------------------ */
  .bt-entry { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .bt-entry__grid { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .bt-entry__grid .bt-head { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .bt-versus { display: grid; }
  .bt-versus__card { padding: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 32px); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-card); }
  .bt-versus__card h3 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: var(--fs-h4); }
